sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller
    participant Application
    participant DataSourceProperties
    participant DatasourcesMap as Datasources Map

    Caller->>Application: select appropriate datasource for tenant context
    activate Application
    Note right of Application: tenantId: current tenant identifier

    Application->>DataSourceProperties: request datasource via getDatasources
    activate DataSourceProperties

    DataSourceProperties->>DatasourcesMap: retrieve datasources map
    activate DatasourcesMap
    DatasourcesMap-->>DataSourceProperties: Map[String, DataSource] (All configured tenant datasources)
    deactivate DatasourcesMap

    DataSourceProperties-->>Application: return Map containing all tenant datasources Map[String, DataSource] (Tenant datasources map)
    deactivate DataSourceProperties

    Application-->>Caller: DataSource (Tenant-specific datasource)
    deactivate Application
